      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 19 · Due-Date Alert\nGST, ITR, TDS, advance tax: har client ko uski service ke hisaab se due date se 7, 3 aur 1 din pehle WhatsApp reminder. Koi deadline miss nahi.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Google Sheets: **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential, paste your sheet URL in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL.\n   Tab **Deadlines**: Filing, Due date, Applies to.\n   Tab **Clients**: Client, Phone, Services, Status.\n   Tab **Reminder log** (empty).\n2. WhatsApp nodes: **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential + your **Phone Number ID** (replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID).\n\nCheck the official due dates each month – extensions happen. Edit ALERT_DAYS in the code node.",
        "height": 540,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
